  "reason": "The strongest completed model is RNA-only scvi_n200 with multiprofile and transformer aggregation (config_006, 0.653 acc / 0.628 F1), while image-only models are much weaker, leaving the key uncertainty as whether image features add complementary value under fusion. This experiment tests that directly by adding the slightly stronger ViT image branch to the best RNA settings while keeping profile setting and aggregation fixed, using simple concat fusion as a baseline. It is the best next use of budget because it isolates the multimodal extension from confounds like weighted fusion or weaker RNA/image choices, and it will clarify whether fusion is worth further exploration."
